===Etymology===
From {{etyl|es|en}} {{term|huitlacoche|lang=la}}, an alteration of {{term|cuitlacoche|lang=es}}, from {{etyl|nci|en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˌwitləˈkoʊtʃeɪ/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# [[corn smut|Corn smut]] prepared as a [[delicacy]]
